abstract: >-
  Rules-first extraction of a cited lease abstract from South African residential leases,
  compliance findings against the Rental Housing Act, CPA s14, POPIA and Rental Housing
  Tribunal unfair-practice patterns, and number-consistent tenant and landlord summaries.
  Not legal advice.
